  "instructions": [
    "In a small bowl, whisk together eggs, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Heat olive oil in a 6-inch non-stick skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add thinly sliced red onion and cook for 2-3 minutes or until softened.",
    "Add chopped parsley and dill and cook for another minute.",
    "Pour the whisked eggs over the onion mixture and cook for 2-3 minutes or until the eggs start to set.",
    "Sprinkle crumbled feta cheese over the eggs and fold the omelette in half.",
    "Cook for another minute or until the cheese is melted and the eggs are cooked through.",
    "Transfer the omelette to a serving plate and drizzle with tomato ketchup and a squeeze of lemon juice."
  ],
